        <mxCell id="t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#232F3E;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="DuckStore &amp;#8212; business process: from browsing to a completed order&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;color:#5A6C86&quot;&gt;Cross-functional model. Each lane is a business capability; each column is a stage of the process. The colour of a box says whether the customer is waiting for that step or not.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
